{"channelId":"UC9KjTv0kNLCeKvqYFwSeUXw","row":["Dr.JayPetTalks",20,"🐾 Pet Care Unleashed\n\nWelcome to Dr.JayPetTalks — where better pet parenting begins! 🐾\n\nI’m a veterinarian, pet parent to my beloved Mango, and a veterinary surgeon with experience caring for and performing operations on exotic animals. 🐶🐱🦜🐢\n\nHere, I’ll share practical vet tips, pet-care advice, preventive health guidance, nutrition, common problems, and better ways to understand and care for your pets — from everyday companions to fascinating exotic animals.\n\nWhether you’re a first-time pet parent or a lifelong animal lover, Mango and I are here to help you give your pets a healthier, happier life. ❤️\n\n👉🏻 Subscribe and join us → because your pet deserves the very best! 🐾\n👉🏻 Follow me in 📷 Instagram → https://www.instagram.com/dr.jaypettalks/","","India"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9KjTv0kNLCeKvqYFwSeUXw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9KjTv0kNLCeKvqYFwSeUXw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:29.311Z","channelId":"UC9KjTv0kNLCeKvqYFwSeUXw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d07243d84355246f25d97897696db6d9c4b2eccb330c06c05e1c484cd8a5777d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"c5f435eee7718e7693c94fa789dda0f8d23430a4742b9c59ba54046ad5945811"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9KjTv0kNLCeKvqYFwSeUXw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:29.311Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9KjTv0kNLCeKvqYFwSeUXw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":20,"raw":"20 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9KjTv0kNLCeKvqYFwSeUXw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:29.311Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"practitioner_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls